flowchart LR
  dev[Developer push to main] --> gha[GitHub Actions]
  gha --> test[test: pytest]
  test --> build[build-push: buildx to GHCR]
  build --> kind[deploy: kind cluster]
  kind --> apply[kubectl apply api and Neo4j]
  apply --> smoke[rollout status and /health]
  smoke -->|failure| undo[rollout undo and fail]
  smoke -->|success| live[Service ready]
